      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please do not add this back. It's nice that the names require someone to check since someone has to actually act out for their rank to be in question. I may be trusted now but when I first joined the game I recall being blocked several times when I didn't say a word, only had a white name tag. Each time it was by a purple name. This goes the other way too. Those with purple names could seem holier than thou. I don't think this feature should ever be added back into the game. This feature ever being in the game was a miss step. Getting rid of it was a huge step in the right direction, thank you VRchat devs for removing the colored nametags",
