  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What Feature?\nI've played since Jan 2019, and having Trust Colors on the tags is something I've really missed. Could we have it as a local toggle possibly? That would be nice.\nWhy This Feature?\n I find this an easy way to gauge whether or not I'll enjoy a public instance I've just joined, or if I'm more likely to be annoyed. I know this feature was originally taken away reduce segregation, but I never saw much of an issue with that to begin with. Besides, it's a lot nicer to look at in my opinion, vs a bunch of boring grey nametags.",
